OL,3,AInvestors sue chip giant Intel after
OL,4,A29% stock plunge
OL,5,
OL,6,FShareholders have sued US chip giant
OL,7,FIntel, accusing it of hiding the
OL,8,Fseverity of a slump in personal
OL,9,Fcomputer (PC) sales, which they say led
OL,10,Fto a nearly 29% one-day collapse in the
OL,11,Ffirm's stock.
OL,13,FA proposed class action lawsuit in San
OL,14,FJose, California said Intel was too
OL,15,Flate to alert shareholders about how
OL,16,Fslowing sales could impact its
OL,17,Fearnings, allegedly artificially
OL,18,Finflating its stock price.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
